    "spklu": "Stations ≠ connectors, charging sessions, energy sold, or revenue. DKI Jakarta/SPKLU is a count for 2025, not per-capita or utilization. Annual kWh available only nationally.",
    "coal": "Verified resources and reserves (geological) ≠ annual coal production (national series) and should not be classified as 2026 mine operating output.",
    "bioenergy": "Plant capacity (kL per year) ≠ physical biodiesel fuel output (thousand kL/year). Export, domestic sales and production have different boundaries.",
